{%- comment -%}
  Veloura logo lockup — emblem (V monogram) + VELOURA wordmark.
  Rendered as an image (assets/veloura-logo.png) in the header in place of
  the plain shop name. The PNG has a transparent background (keyed + trimmed),
  so it sits cleanly on any header colour. Sized via CSS (.veloura-logo__img).
{%- endcomment -%}
<span class="veloura-logo">
  <img
    class="veloura-logo__img"
    src="{{ 'veloura-logo.png' | asset_img_url: '400x' }}"
    alt="{{ shop.name | default: 'Veloura' | escape }}"
    width="1283"
    height="242"
    loading="eager">
</span>
